## Graphical abstract
A simple methodology for the synthesis of $\mathrm{Pt}/\mathrm{ZrO}_{2}/$ porous carbons tri-component nanohybrids, a highly effective electrocatalyst for methyl parathion, were prepared by one-step pyrolysis of Pt/MOF-UiO-66 without the need of additional precursors.
